# Model & Experiment Rules

Use the same data filter, training recipe, metric set, and split policy for models being compared. Split by subject/session, never leak by trial. Cross-session validation is carved only from source train. Target labels are only for final evaluation unless an offline diagnostic report explicitly declares target-label use.

All models share `{logits, features, confidence}`. Do not mark Prototype Drift, online, memory, or full CAP-EEGNet as complete until result files exist.
